WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:06.070
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and since Sylvester
McCoy was just caught talking about a New

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:09.820
Master for Doctor Who Series 8, I thought
it was time to talk about or top 10 choices

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:10.820
for a new Master.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.179
We need to think of people that would work
really well with this new more serious tone

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.430
Peter Capaldi is supposedly bringing to the
series.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:20.890
Full disclosure, Sylvester McCoy said he knew
who the new Master was, during a recent convention

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:21.890
in Newcastle.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:24.529
That means either he’s blowing steam or
there really is a brand new Master coming.

00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:27.669
For the purposes of this video, let’s just
assume he was speaking truthfully.

00:00:27.669 --> 00:00:32.590
And since this is a pretty big deal I’ll
try to get a follow up Q&amp;A video out by next

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:33.590
Tuesday.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:34.590
If you’re finding me for the first time,
be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:39.780
So first off we need to acknowledge the rumor
that Charles Dance who plays Tywin Lannister

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.500
on Game of Thrones has been offered the role.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.870
Book readers will understand why that might
work out from a production scheduling standpoint

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.399
between Season 4 of Thrones and Series 8 of
Doctor Who.

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:50.249
Please don’t post spoilers in the comments
though.

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:51.850
But there are so many other similar actors
who have also been named as being in talks,

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:52.850
all of whom are every bit as scary as Tywin
Lannister.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:55.410
So lets’ talk about our Top 10 Picks for
The Master including some of those rumored

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.410
people.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:57.920
Number 10 - Billy Nighy.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.519
Yes he did already appear in and episode as
another character, but The Master is meant

00:01:02.519 --> 00:01:04.860
to be the antithesis of The Doctor.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:08.979
And as we learned in the 50th Anniversary,
The Doctor is destined to become caretaker

00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:10.130
of a museum.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.990
So it would fit thematically that The Master
would also have the same type of job at some

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:13.990
point.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:18.370
Nighy has played several grand villains in
I, Frankenstein, Pirates of The Caribbean

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.100
and the Underworld series.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.200
It’s really his Davy Jones role that makes
me think he could pull off role though.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.399
I always thought of The Master as a tragic
villain as depicted in The End of Time.

00:01:28.399 --> 00:01:31.250
And that’s exactly what his Davy Jones character
was.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:35.869
I’ll say that I have several vanity choices
and he’s definitely one of them.

00:01:35.869 --> 00:01:37.590
Number 9 - Jason Isaacs.

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.700
One of a few Harry Potter actors on my list.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.610
I really liked his Lucius Malfoy character
in the earlier films before Voldemort arrived

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.750
and cowed him into submission.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.150
He has played more viscious characters, but
there’s something about the characters in

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:54.830
Harry Potter that gives them this old-timey
ness that I feel we’re going to see in Series

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:55.830
8.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:58.290
Especially with that first episode back in
Victorian London.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:02.799
I always felt like Doctor Who was kind of
a period story, so all the best actors on

00:02:02.799 --> 00:02:05.560
the show were also good period actors.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.140
Number 8 - Emma Thompson.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.149
Harry Potter Actor number 2.

00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:10.330
But only by coincidence.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.390
Trelawny would be an awful Master.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:13.910
Could you just imagine.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:17.890
Thompson though is one of the great leading
ladies originating from the UK and she’s

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:20.980
at the right age to play against Capaldi’s
older Doctor.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:24.940
She’s mostly known for playing non-threatening
characters and mostly her roles haven’t

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.550
let her be very evil in the grand sense.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:30.570
But I would love to see her play someone analogous
to Voldemort.

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:36.460
I even picked he who must not be named as
one of my choices for a new Time Lord.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.190
Doctor Who has a history of casting multiple
Harry Potter actors in the same episode.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.780
Number 7 - Harry Lloyd.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:48.090
Who better to play the Master in after a Dickensian
Series 8 opening than the real life great

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.990
great grandson of Charles Dickens.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.740
Seriously, Harry Lloyd is related to Charles
Dickens.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:57.370
He’s also had amazing roles in Devil’s
Whore and The Iron Lady as powerful characters

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:00.760
and he’s also one of two Game of Thrones
actors on the list.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.070
Yes, he was Viserys Targaryen.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.090
Crowned in molten gold.

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:07.790
Isn’t it a funny coincidence that he also
starred in The Hollow Crown.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.810
The Master is really the creation of the Time
Lords, but he wants to be King of the Universe

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.490
just as badly as Viserys wanted the Iron Throne.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:16.850
Number 6 - Chiwetel Ejiofor.

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:21.590
Mostly known for protagonists and now for
his work in 12 Years a Slave, Ejiofor previously

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:26.160
had an amazing run against The 9th Doctor
Christopher Eccleston in The Shadow Line.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:28.650
So in a meta kind of way he’s had a practice
run.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:32.100
Capaldi’s portrayal is going to be very
different than Eccleston’s so he’d have

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.800
to be a little more grand.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:38.130
But he also played a very ambiguous if not
effective villain in Joss Whedon’s Serenity.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:42.810
I don’t think that character would be passionate
enough to be The Master, but Ejiofor is just

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:45.890
so good I have no doubt he would be amazing.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.780
Number 5 - Benedict Cumberbatch.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.510
For fans of a certain age, or maybe everyone.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:54.100
Cumberbatch is the most popular choice for
idosyncratic characters.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:58.900
It’s like everyone has their list of favorite
actors and everywhere in the world he’s

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.200
somewhere in the top 5.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.900
Which is why he’d probably never have the
time to do it.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:06.820
But picture his version of The Master with
the wit and appearance of Sherlock and the

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:08.540
Voice of Smaug the Dragon.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.200
The Master really is like the genetic blend
of those two characters.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.410
Grand, evil, precise, calculating and terrifying.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:17.290
Number 4 - Alan Rickman.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:21.281
Dial it back from a dragon a little bit and
you have a much more practical villain, the

00:04:21.281 --> 00:04:24.389
third Harry Potter actor on the list, Severus
Snape.

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:28.250
Arguably one of the best tragic villains or
tragic heroes in recent memory.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.849
Depending on how you look at it.

00:04:29.849 --> 00:04:33.819
The other evil role that really comes to mind
is his Hans Gruber from Die Hard.

00:04:33.819 --> 00:04:37.330
He’s as admired for it as he is parodied.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.139
Which I think is perfect for Doctor Who.

00:04:39.139 --> 00:04:43.680
It’s a series that at both times is beloved
and just a little bit silly.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.979
Usually the showrunner is mostly the one that
informs that second part.

00:04:46.979 --> 00:04:50.560
The humor of Moffat’s run is slowly turning
into something else and if the rumors are

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:51.629
to be believed.

00:04:51.629 --> 00:04:52.750
Coming to an end.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:54.500
Number 3 - Gary Oldman.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:58.020
Harry Potter Actor number 4 on the list, I
sense a trend.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:02.659
One of the best character actors working right
now and willing to try just about anything.

00:05:02.659 --> 00:05:06.789
He actually said that the main reason he took
the role of Sirius Black in Harry Potter was

00:05:06.789 --> 00:05:07.999
because of his children.

00:05:07.999 --> 00:05:11.290
Let’s hope that his children are also Doctor
Who fans.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:15.740
Imagine a blend of his characters from Tinker,
Tailor, Soldier, Spy and Dracula.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:16.740
Maybe even just Dracula.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:20.259
What I’m saying is, I would love to see
Dracula be the new Master.

00:05:20.259 --> 00:05:24.310
Didn’t Gordon Tipple’s Master look like
he could have been a vampire?

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.860
Number 2 - Malcolm Mcdowell.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:29.580
One of the most iconic villain character actors
of the last 40 years.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:34.500
I consider his Alex character from Clockwork
Orange to be a spiritual Father to Andrew

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.800
Scott’s Moriarty.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:39.689
If Capaldi almost seems like he could be Matt
Smith’s father, then who better to play

00:05:39.689 --> 00:05:42.699
the counterpart to John Simm than McDowell.

00:05:42.699 --> 00:05:46.830
In fairness, he is the oldest person on this
list and seems more like a more sinister version

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.720
of Derek Jacobi’s Master.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.780
And I really think they’ll go with someone
younger and a little more prominent in the

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.469
eyes of audiences right now.

00:05:53.469 --> 00:05:56.250
Which leads me to my Number 1 pick - Tywin
Lannister.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.669
I mean Charles Dance.

00:05:57.669 --> 00:06:02.210
Due to the incredible popularity of Game of
Thrones it’s hard to think of him without

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.699
thinking of Tywin.

00:06:03.699 --> 00:06:07.970
But outside of the rumors that he’s already
been cast, there are so many things that scream

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.650
“Yes” about this.

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.560
First, The pedigree of evil.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.979
That actually sounds like a good title for
an episode.

00:06:13.979 --> 00:06:18.449
He’s played several amazing villains and
is mostly known for playing distinguished

00:06:18.449 --> 00:06:19.449
characters.

00:06:19.449 --> 00:06:22.289
That is to say The Master will not appear
as a fool.

00:06:22.289 --> 00:06:25.110
Then look at the perspective of the BBC.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.009
They want the show to be as popular as possible.

00:06:28.009 --> 00:06:32.410
The best way to do that is to find amazing
actors that are incredibly popular.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.639
For more on this refer back to my Benedict
Cumberbatch choice.

00:06:35.639 --> 00:06:40.020
Right now next to Walking Dead, Game of Thrones
is one of the most internationally popular

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.789
shows on television.

00:06:41.789 --> 00:06:47.060
Meaning almost anyone who watches TV probably
knows and fears Charles Dance.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:51.270
Imagine a more forthcoming version of Tywin
dressed in Victorian clothing.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.650
Which opens a whole new topic of discussion
for a future video.

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.849
What should the new Master’s costume look
like?

00:06:56.849 --> 00:07:00.189
And with that I’ll pass it to you guys,
let me know who you want to see as the new

00:07:00.189 --> 00:07:04.530
Master and do you believe the rumors that
Charles Dance has already been picked.

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.500
Like I said I’ll try to get a Q&amp;A video
up on Tuesday to follow up on this so subscribe

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:12.129
to get it if you’re new to my channel and
leave your questions.

00:07:12.129 --> 00:07:13.129
Big stuff tonight too.

00:07:13.129 --> 00:07:18.729
There’s a new Game of Thrones trailer that
I’ll be posting and new Walking Dead.

00:07:18.729 --> 00:07:23.409
Right now click here to learn about the newest
actor they just cast for series 8 and click

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:25.740
here for my top 10 picks for new Time Lords.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.960
Thanks for Watching, see you guys tonight.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:28.669
High Fives!

